abstract: >-
  Reproducible code, frozen artifacts, and registered models for strict
  TCR CDR3 beta-peptide-HLA interaction benchmarking with distance-aware
  splits, degree-matched putative negatives, internal resampling, and
  publication-independent IEDB validation.
